Node ID=900 order templar knelt killer
Text=The Knights Templar came out of the siege with their chapter houses standing and their numbers halved, and within the year Lord Javier swore the order to the power he had called his benefactor. You had worn their cross and you had killed men wearing it, and the order never found a way to put both facts on the same page. The commanderies took their new instructions quietly. Those who objected were reassigned to postings they did not come back from, and inside a generation the white cross was a thing worn in the desert's service. Your name stayed in the rolls eleven years, and was then struck out by a hand nobody signed for.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
