Text=The Knights Templar came out of the siege with their chapter houses standing and their numbers halved, and within the year Lord Javier swore the order to the power he had called his benefactor. You had stood close enough to Javier to be counted among his own, and when he knelt there was no record of you being anywhere else. The commanderies took their new instructions quietly. Those who objected were reassigned to postings they did not come back from, and inside a generation the white cross was a thing worn in the desert's service. The men who carried it there had trained under you.
