Node ID=900 order templar mid knelt
Text=The Knights Templar came out of the siege with their chapter houses standing and their numbers halved, and within the year Lord Javier swore the order to the power he had called his benefactor. You had carried their banner the length of the war, from the Port District chapter to the relic vaults at Montserrat, and knights who had trained beside you rose behind you. The commanderies took their new instructions quietly, and those who objected were reassigned to postings they did not come back from. Inside a generation the white cross was a thing worn in the desert's service, carried by men who had learned how to carry it from watching you.
