Node ID=900 order saladin high
Text=The Knights of Saladin kept the pact of east and west after the west had stopped keeping it, and after Alamut they kept it alone. You had been named a Favored One, the first westerner in living memory given the title, and the men who argued against it were outnumbered rather than persuaded. They held the eastern shrines for two generations against raids the west never heard about, and were called weak for it by men who had never fought them. Your name stayed in the recitation at Alamut long after anybody there could have said what you looked like.
