}
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=900 order wielder exposed
Text=La Calle Perdida was found, and it was found because you told the Inquisition where to look. You had been inside as a friend first, which is the only reason your directions were good enough to act on. The Holy Office took the quarter apart over nine days, and what the Wielders had kept hidden for a century was catalogued, carted out and burned in the open. Cedric's library went in the third load. A handful got away through the sewers and taught what they could remember to people who did not understand what they were being given, and inside two generations it was gone.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
