Node ID=900 order wielder killer
Text=La Calle Perdida was never found, not by the Inquisition and not by the knights. You had walked its streets as a friend and left Wielder dead behind you, and in a city that small both of those were known before you reached the gate. The magic the Church had tried to drown went on under the streets without you, and was taught in the open again long after everyone who had hidden it was dead. The door you had been given was not opened a second time. They never hunted you for it, which was its own kind of answer.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
