Node ID=900 order horde mid
Text=The goblin tribes came down out of the mountains, counted themselves, and found that they were many, and that nothing in the west was counting at all. You had been blooded among them, which is further than almost any outsider gets, and the tribes argued for years afterward about what exactly that had made you. A Khan's banner rose again inside three generations. The border towns burned first, and the chronicles of the west recorded it as a surprise. Your name came up in their arguments about the succession, and was voted down, and came up again.
