Node ID=900 friend joan
Text=Jehanne d'Arc left the Crypt of the Bleeding Lance for the first time in nine years and did not look back at it. She had been set there to guard a relic and had guarded it well past the point where anyone was coming to relieve her. In France she was given soldiers, briefly, and then given to a court, and the court was told what she had been doing in a crypt in Spain and did not believe that either. She was certain the entire time. She asked after you once, by rank, and was told that nobody of that name had ever been knighted.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
