Node ID=900 friend joan released
Text=Jehanne d'Arc stopped. Two hundred years of holding one gallery ended in a sentence somebody else worded carefully to an efreet, and she had time to say *Dieu est avec vous* before the rest of it caught up with her. Her knights went in the same minute, all down the corridor, in no particular order and without being told to. The Lance stayed where it was. The Spirit Council never explained itself to anybody, and what was left in that crypt afterwards was ordinary stone, which is the first thing it had been in two centuries.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
