Node ID=900 friend joan passed
Text=Jehanne raised the gate and let you by, which she had done for nobody in two hundred years, and then went back to standing exactly where she had been standing. You took the Lance out of the tomb below her and she did not stop you, having been told by somebody she believed that the Council wished it so. The Council never spoke to her again and she went on listening for it. She was still there when the crypt was sealed, nobody ever lifted the curse, and she would not have asked anybody twice.
Should Have Voiceover=1

