Node ID=900 friend joan killed
Text=You killed Jehanne d'Arc where she stood, with the Council she had trusted for two centuries not answering, and took the Bleeding Lance off a knight who had been set to guard it and never once relieved. Her knights fought on until there was nothing left to fight for. The curse was never lifted, there being nobody left for it to be on. She had told you she was the maiden and the commander of the army of France, and she had been telling the truth the entire time. The gallery was quiet afterwards for the first time in two hundred years.
Should Have Voiceover=1

