Node ID=900 friend roger dead
Text=Sir Roger Templeton died in the field, and the order's rolls got it right by accident, having already recorded him dead in Spain once. The men who sealed the Shrine afterwards had never heard his argument about the druids and sealed it on general principle instead. England stopped being a place that remembered the alliance inside a generation, there being nobody left who had been told to argue about it. His sword went to a nephew who sold it. The entry beside his name reads *abroad*, which is the whole of what the order knew.
