Node ID=900 friend roger alone
Text=Sir Roger Templeton offered you his sword three times, in the formula his order keeps for strangers of rank, and you went into the Shrine without him. He went in later with men of his own and came out with fewer of them, and the order wrote the action up as a success because the Cross came back. He was given a garrison in Kent and the kind of duty that goes to men who are owed something and trusted with nothing. He never told anybody that he had made the offer, which is the only part of it he was ashamed of.
Should Have Voiceover=1

