Node ID=900 friend grumdjum killed
Text=Grumdjum died in the Wilderness at your hands, mid-sentence, which was the one ending he had never thought to compose. He had been working on the verse for years and reciting it to whoever stopped walking, and it went with him. Goblins who had heard pieces of it argued about the pieces for a season and then stopped. The dryad he wanted dead outlived him by a century. He had promised to make an epic of your long torture, and he had been joking, and he was the only goblin in the Horde who would have bothered to joke with you.
Should Have Voiceover=1

