}
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=900 friend diego dead
Text=Bishop Diego died in the Wilderness with his eyes most of the way gone, and his post stood unfilled for six years afterwards, the Inquisition having no record of anyone ever being assigned to it. He had gone out with you knowing exactly how little he could see. The stone room became a shepherds' shelter and then a ruin. Nobody local could say what the old blind man had been doing there, only that he had been there a long time, and had called everyone *my child*, and had meant it. He had asked to be buried where he fell and was, under a cairn the shepherds kept adding to.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
