Node ID=900 friend diego sold
Text=You took the Dark Inquisitors' coin and killed a blind bishop on the south road of the plains, which took a good deal less doing than they had led you to expect. They paid, and spoke about you afterwards in the admiring way of people who have found somebody worse than themselves. The stone room stood empty for six years and then became a shepherds' shelter. He had called you *my child* at the end of every conversation the two of you ever had, including the last one, which he did not know was the last one.
Should Have Voiceover=1

