Node ID=900 friend darsh
Text=Inquisitor Darsh wrote his own rescue up as a tactical withdrawal and was promoted on it. He had been in a goblin camp long enough to be written off and came out with his magic and most of his dignity intact, and he never once used the word rescue in your hearing. His report mentions a young one who was present. He ran the Wilderness chapter for eleven years, concealed considerably more heretics than he burned, for reasons he took to the grave, and would have been appalled to hear it put that way. He was buried in the chapter house with full honours, the withdrawal cited by name.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
