Node ID=900 friend goblin girl
Text=The Khan's daughter left the Warrens with you and did not come back, which cost her father a daughter and a bargaining chip and a quantity of face. Her mother was proved right about you at a volume audible from the pass. She grew into something the Horde had no word for, being neither Khan's blood in the Warrens nor anything at all anywhere else, and it turned out to suit her. She kept a running count of everything she had eaten on the road and recited it to strangers. Nobody who met her later believed she had been a Khan's daughter, and she never minded.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
