------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=900 friend goblin girl dead
Text=The Khan's daughter died away from the Warrens, in company her mother had warned her about, and the Horde took it the way a Horde takes such things. The Khan wanted a name. He was given yours, eventually, by a goblin who had been there, and he did nothing about it for reasons that were political rather than paternal. Her mother was right twice and took no satisfaction in it either time. She had asked you once whether there were more of you and whether they were all so cute, and had been told, and had not believed it.
Should Have Voiceover=1

