Node ID=900 friend saladin knight
Text=The Knight of Saladin rode east from Alamut and reported, at length and accurately, and was not entirely believed about the Old Man. The order had expected to lose him and had already said the prayers. He spent the rest of his service training men for a fortress that was no longer there, on the grounds that the next one would be similar. He greeted everybody with *Salaam*, including men he was about to fight, and his students copied it without understanding why. Your name is in his report, spelled three different ways in the same paragraph.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
