------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=900 friend saladin knight dead
Text=The Knight of Saladin died inside the fortress he had ridden a thousand miles to enter, and the order said the prayers it had already said once. His report was never written, so what was in Alamut stayed a rumour in the east for two generations and then stopped being discussed at all. The men he would have trained were trained by somebody else, less well. He had told you his sword was yours in the first minute of knowing you, in the formula his order kept for strangers, and had meant it in a way the formula does not require.
