Node ID=900 friend fernand
Text=Fernand Desoto went back to the water, which surprised everyone who had watched him begging for help on the dock and nobody who had sailed with him. He and Juan worked the Barcelona coast for another thirty years and never once went north past the island. He told the story of his brother's rescue to every crew he ever shipped with, in a version where he did rather more and you did rather less, and Juan corrected him in front of them every time. He named a boat after you. It was a small boat and it leaked.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
