Node ID=900 friend fernand dead
Text=Fernand Desoto died inland, which for a sailor is its own joke and one he would have made first. Juan heard about it in a port three weeks later, from a man who had all the details wrong. He worked the coast alone after that and stopped going near the island altogether, and told the rescue story exactly once a year, accurately, which is how everyone who heard it knew he had not made it up. There is no boat named after you. Juan considered it and could not afford a boat, and kept his brother's name on the licence for the rest of his working life.
Should Have Voiceover=1

