Node ID=900 friend fernand brother lost
Text=Fernand Desoto went back to the water alone, which the dock had expected of him and he had not. He worked the Barcelona coast for another thirty years, never once went north past the island, never told a crew why, and was understood by every crew he shipped with. He told the rescue story once, to a man who asked him twice, and told it accurately, which is how that man knew not to ask a third time. There is a boat named after you. He bought it cheap and kept it afloat long past its worth.
