Node ID=900 friend fernand dead both
Text=Fernand Desoto died inland, which for a sailor is its own joke and the one he would have made first, and there was nobody left who would have got it. The brothers are in no parish register in Barcelona, having been born somewhere that kept none either. A landlord in the Port District held their account open for two years out of a habit he could not account for, and then closed it. The island is still there. Nothing on that coast is named for either of them, or for you. The boat he had meant to buy went to somebody else and sank inside the year.
