Node ID=900 friend grace dead
Text=Grace O'Malley died a long way from the sea, which she had told you more than once was the only end she was afraid of. Her ships were taken by a cousin who had been waiting on exactly that news and were sailing under another name inside the year. The harbour she had kept out of the Crown's hands was taken by the Crown by the following spring. No Ireland survivor was ever told where she had gone or what she had been doing there, and the story her crews told about Barcelona stopped having an ending, so in time they stopped telling it.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
