------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=900 friend fang dead
Text=The cub died grown, in a fight he had no business being in and was not asked about. The hunters were back in the eastern woods inside two years. Nobody wrote him down except Grumdjum, who put him in the poem as a demon and gave him a stanza he had not earned and would have been pleased by. You had taken him off a man who was going to sell him. On the balance of it he got years he would not otherwise have had, and a death he would not have chosen, in that order.
Should Have Voiceover=1

