Node ID=900 friend lost knight
Text=The Lost Knight got out of the sewers, which he had been certain of the whole time and had been wrong about until you arrived. He reported to Auric that his brothers had sent help, which was not what had happened, and Auric let it stand. He never afterwards referred to the thieves as anything but accursed, and never explained to anyone junior how he had come to be lying in their vault with his head open. He was a good knight for twenty more years, on the strength of a rescue he had confidently predicted and could not possibly have survived without.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
Go to node ID=
Custom Action=CTriggerRelayAction
