------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=900 friend lost knight dead
Text=The Lost Knight died under Barcelona after all, which was the ending the thieves had arranged for him before you ever got there. He had been entirely sure his brothers were coming. Auric never learned whether they had, having sent nobody, and the order recorded him missing, missing being the entry that required no further action. The thieves kept the vault another eleven years. The last thing he said was that he had expected a more seasoned knight, and he said it as a compliment he had not yet finished building. Auric prayed for him annually, from a list, among nineteen other names.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
