Node ID=900 friend lost knight killed
Text=You killed a Templar in a thieves' vault and then told Sir Auric that he had met an unfortunate end in the sewers, which was true in every particular and complete in none of them. Auric wrote it up as a patrol lost underground and stopped sending patrols. The thieves kept the vault for another eleven years and never learned they had been done a favour. He had been entirely certain that his brothers were coming for him, and nobody has ever told them that one of them did. Auric prayed for him annually, from a list, among nineteen other names.
Should Have Voiceover=1

