Node ID=900 friend lost knight returned
Text=The Lost Knight went back to his duties, which is the phrase he used and the whole of the thanks he gave, and he was perfectly sincere in both. He told the order that his brothers had come for him, because that is what he had been certain of underground and he was not going to start doubting it in daylight. Auric, who had sent one stranger, did not correct him. He served another twenty years and never once explained to anybody junior how he had come to be lying in a vault with his head open.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
